WEBVTT

00:14.070 --> 00:17.010
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

00:18.200 --> 00:20.850
♪Let go of all regrets♪

00:20.850 --> 00:26.260
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

00:27.730 --> 00:31.280
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

00:31.830 --> 00:36.120
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

00:37.080 --> 00:40.630
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

00:41.620 --> 00:43.830
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

00:43.830 --> 00:46.870
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

00:46.870 --> 00:48.950
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

00:48.950 --> 00:53.010
♪I have no regrets♪

00:53.520 --> 00:58.290
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

00:58.290 --> 01:02.580
♪I pray for a miracle♪

01:02.580 --> 01:03.990
♪Over the time♪

01:03.990 --> 01:06.000
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

01:06.000 --> 01:08.850
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

01:08.850 --> 01:12.120
♪Of being with you forever♪

01:12.120 --> 01:16.820
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

01:17.520 --> 01:25.170
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

01:37.840 --> 01:43.200
=Sword and Fairy=

01:43.500 --> 01:46.890
=Episode 16=

01:47.210 --> 01:51.600
(Ningzheng Hall)

01:59.830 --> 02:00.350
Who's there?

02:03.640 --> 02:04.150
Mr. Zuo.

02:04.670 --> 02:05.750
I am Luo Zhaoyan.

02:05.750 --> 02:06.510
We came abruptly

02:06.560 --> 02:07.400
for something urgent.

02:09.280 --> 02:11.560
Jinzhao, will this really work?

02:11.900 --> 02:12.500
Rest assured.

02:12.700 --> 02:14.020
It's definitely going to work.

02:14.180 --> 02:16.020
Come on, repeat what I told you.

02:16.740 --> 02:17.220
Yeah.

02:17.660 --> 02:19.540
I will defeat you fair and square.

02:19.900 --> 02:21.100
And make you beg me for mercy.

02:22.300 --> 02:23.980
I will defeat you fair and square.

02:27.540 --> 02:27.980
Go ahead.

02:29.460 --> 02:30.260
Gentlemen.

02:30.740 --> 02:31.500
Well,

02:31.500 --> 02:33.380
I'm here to do justice to my buddy.

02:34.100 --> 02:35.260
Who's making a scene?

02:39.180 --> 02:40.940
Isn't it Mr. Ju who got kicked out?

02:40.940 --> 02:41.780
I will defeat you...

02:42.100 --> 02:44.140
Are you here

02:44.380 --> 02:46.380
to beg for your position back?

02:46.380 --> 02:47.420
Defeat you fair and square.

02:47.420 --> 02:47.900
Shifang.

02:50.500 --> 02:51.900
I will beg you for mercy.

02:56.220 --> 02:57.300
No, wait.

02:57.420 --> 02:58.100
That was wrong.

02:59.100 --> 03:00.860
I will defeat you fair and square

03:01.140 --> 03:02.700
and make you beg me for mercy.

03:02.940 --> 03:04.260
You can't even speak.

03:04.660 --> 03:05.580
And you wish to win?

03:07.740 --> 03:08.660
Come on, guys.

03:09.020 --> 03:10.300
I'm sure you know it.

03:10.580 --> 03:11.660
My buddy

03:11.860 --> 03:14.020
is the head of the Jiqiao Hall
in the Zhengwu Alliance.

03:14.340 --> 03:15.620
He's highly capable.

03:16.460 --> 03:17.260
Unfortunately,

03:17.380 --> 03:20.060
his fellow people were bullying him.

03:20.660 --> 03:21.340
Today,

03:21.579 --> 03:23.020
I'm going to do him justice...

03:23.180 --> 03:23.620
Defeat them.

03:23.620 --> 03:25.900
And show you what he's capable of.

03:26.579 --> 03:27.260
Shifang.

03:29.140 --> 03:30.900
Yeah, I'm going to fight you.

03:30.980 --> 03:31.720
- Alright!
- Alright!

03:31.980 --> 03:32.660
- Alright!
- Alright!

03:32.820 --> 03:34.220
- Alright!
- How are you going to fight?

03:37.980 --> 03:38.460
Alright.

03:39.460 --> 03:40.300
Let's fight

03:40.660 --> 03:41.620
two on two.

03:42.060 --> 03:42.940
If we win,

03:43.340 --> 03:44.660
you will do something for us.

03:45.060 --> 03:45.980
If we lose,

03:46.100 --> 03:46.660
then

03:46.780 --> 03:48.900
we will do something for you.

03:49.380 --> 03:49.820
Okay?

03:50.740 --> 03:51.380
Deal.

03:53.660 --> 03:54.670
It's okay if you lose.

03:55.220 --> 03:56.340
Mr. Ju, all we want

03:56.540 --> 03:58.579
is to have fun
with your bear for a few days.

03:59.620 --> 04:00.460
In your dreams.

04:06.300 --> 04:06.940
- There.
- There.

04:07.780 --> 04:08.180
There.

04:08.300 --> 04:09.020
They're starting.

05:24.060 --> 05:24.860
- Nice!
- Nice!

05:25.860 --> 05:26.820
- Not bad!
- Alright!

05:32.300 --> 05:33.420
- Nice!
- Nice!

05:42.500 --> 05:44.540
- Great!
- Great!

05:47.780 --> 05:48.820
I won.

05:49.100 --> 05:49.780
Jinzhao, I won!

05:52.420 --> 05:54.140
How are you? Are you okay?

05:54.580 --> 05:56.620
You lost.

05:59.580 --> 06:00.300
We accept our defeat.

06:00.380 --> 06:00.940
So,

06:01.540 --> 06:02.300
what do you want?

06:06.500 --> 06:07.300
Thirty taels?

06:08.380 --> 06:09.060
Are they beggars?

06:14.420 --> 06:16.180
T-Three hundred taels?

06:18.020 --> 06:19.540
Qianjun, 300 taels.

06:19.820 --> 06:20.900
Do we have the money?

06:21.380 --> 06:22.060
Of course not.

06:22.460 --> 06:22.980
What do we do?

06:27.420 --> 06:29.300
T-Three thousand taels?

06:30.820 --> 06:31.740
Just kill me...

06:33.180 --> 06:35.220
Bark three times.

06:37.100 --> 06:37.580
You bad guy!

06:38.940 --> 06:40.460
Jinzhao, forget it.

06:41.060 --> 06:43.220
This is too much.

06:43.500 --> 06:45.260
See, Mr. Ju is a reasonable man.

06:46.860 --> 06:47.540
Yeah.

06:47.659 --> 06:48.540
The way I see it,

06:50.100 --> 06:51.060
barking once is enough.

06:55.060 --> 06:56.220
What was I telling you?

06:57.380 --> 06:57.900
Right.

06:58.500 --> 06:59.020
Right.

06:59.220 --> 07:02.140
Well, we're here

07:02.740 --> 07:04.260
to propose

07:04.980 --> 07:05.940
that we join hands

07:06.620 --> 07:07.900
to eradicate the Qiyuan Sect.

07:08.580 --> 07:09.180
Qiyuan Sect.

07:09.300 --> 07:10.020
Qiyuan Sect.

07:10.140 --> 07:10.780
Qiyuan Sect.

07:14.060 --> 07:15.060
Qianjun, Qiming.

07:17.700 --> 07:18.780
You lost because

07:18.940 --> 07:20.180
you haven't mastered the moves.

07:21.060 --> 07:22.300
Practice harder.

07:23.220 --> 07:23.700
- Yes.
- Yes.

07:24.500 --> 07:25.460
People of the Yongwu Hall

07:26.620 --> 07:27.460
should keep our word.

07:28.500 --> 07:30.220
Qianjun, apologize to Mr. Ju.

07:33.260 --> 07:35.100
Mr. Ju, I'm sorry.

07:35.940 --> 07:37.420
We've done you wrong.

07:37.820 --> 07:39.820
Please forgive us.

07:41.260 --> 07:43.060
I-It's okay.

07:43.780 --> 07:45.140
Mr. Ju is truly magnanimous.

07:45.500 --> 07:46.180
I admire you.

07:47.980 --> 07:48.540
Master Yue,

07:49.100 --> 07:50.780
the Alliance Leader invites you inside

07:51.420 --> 07:54.659
to discuss about
the attack on the Qiyuan Sect.

07:55.340 --> 07:56.020
The Qiyuan Sect?

07:56.420 --> 07:58.220
- Great!
- Great!

07:58.220 --> 07:58.780
Let's go.

08:02.740 --> 08:05.100
What a show you put up out there.

08:05.300 --> 08:07.060
You think you can manipulate me?

08:08.020 --> 08:08.740
We dare not.

08:09.140 --> 08:11.660
It's just
that we've had some misunderstanding.

08:11.820 --> 08:12.860
I was worried

08:13.300 --> 08:15.460
that you wouldn't see us
without a proper cause.

08:17.140 --> 08:17.860
Master Yue,

08:19.180 --> 08:21.540
you had it all planned
and played it out well.

08:21.660 --> 08:23.100
What a great team.

08:23.780 --> 08:26.020
I truly admire you.

08:26.140 --> 08:27.500
We came up with this idea

08:27.900 --> 08:28.620
only to meet you

08:29.060 --> 08:30.540
and discuss our plan against

08:30.740 --> 08:31.620
the Qiyuan Sect.

08:32.020 --> 08:33.059
Please don't mind us.

08:35.620 --> 08:36.780
Where is that wolf demon friend

08:37.380 --> 08:39.020
of yours?

08:39.500 --> 08:39.940
Leader.

08:40.740 --> 08:42.059
Senior Xian Qing is a decent man.

08:43.460 --> 08:44.860
I mean, decent demon.

08:45.220 --> 08:46.380
You treated him

08:46.980 --> 08:47.660
so poorly.

08:49.100 --> 08:49.940
Xian Qing

08:50.700 --> 08:52.780
managed to win your trust.

08:53.260 --> 08:54.340
Therefore, I believe

08:54.780 --> 08:56.700
he can't be an evil creature.

08:57.100 --> 08:57.620
Leader,

08:58.300 --> 08:59.420
you agreed to work with us?

09:00.260 --> 09:03.380
I'm not a stubborn or irrational man.

09:03.580 --> 09:05.380
I can tell right from wrong.

09:05.780 --> 09:08.740
The Zhengwu Alliance
will join hands with you

09:09.180 --> 09:10.100
against our enemies.

09:16.940 --> 09:19.580
I have a letter from an old friend.

09:19.980 --> 09:23.340
I'm basically roasted.

09:23.980 --> 09:24.620
Miss Ming.

09:28.720 --> 09:30.420
(The Letter from Senior Gu)

09:30.420 --> 09:31.660
It's Master's handwriting.

09:32.100 --> 09:34.700
Miss Ming. What did Senior Gu write?

09:41.860 --> 09:44.260
Straight to the point. Polite but harsh.

09:44.860 --> 09:46.340
That's Senior Gu's style.

09:49.900 --> 09:50.660
I bet Xian Qing

09:51.260 --> 09:53.540
told Senior Gu about what was going on.

09:54.420 --> 09:57.260
You said that
the stronghold of the Qiyuan Sect

09:57.380 --> 09:58.460
is at the Yinma River.

09:58.820 --> 09:59.700
Are you sure about it?

09:59.820 --> 10:00.380
Absolutely.

10:02.020 --> 10:04.540
Alright, to keep it a secret,

10:04.860 --> 10:07.500
you'd better go there
as soon as possible.

10:08.140 --> 10:08.980
That's our plan.

10:09.740 --> 10:10.500
This time,

10:11.140 --> 10:13.220
I'm going to assign you some

10:13.500 --> 10:14.380
of my top disciples.

10:15.060 --> 10:17.100
They've dealt with
the Qiyuan Sect before.

10:17.300 --> 10:18.140
I believe they'll

10:18.580 --> 10:21.700
help you destroy
the stronghold of the Qiyuan Sect.

10:23.540 --> 10:24.340
Thank you.

10:40.260 --> 10:40.900
Shifang.

10:41.860 --> 10:43.620
Are you upset

10:43.740 --> 10:45.040
because of how Mr. Zuo treated you?

10:46.620 --> 10:47.940
You can tell?

10:49.860 --> 10:52.580
I bet he's very disappointed in me.

10:54.980 --> 10:56.300
Master Luo and I saw something

10:56.460 --> 10:57.380
different.

10:58.140 --> 10:58.620
Leader.

10:59.380 --> 10:59.860
Leader.

11:01.420 --> 11:02.940
Mr. Ju won!

11:10.820 --> 11:11.460
You mean

11:11.700 --> 11:13.420
Mr. Zuo was happy

11:13.540 --> 11:14.380
that I won the fight?

11:16.140 --> 11:18.140
He had high expectations for you.

11:19.380 --> 11:20.140
I thought

11:20.340 --> 11:22.540
he was mad because of Senior Xian Qing.

11:22.780 --> 11:24.180
He was happy
that you helped your friend.

11:24.820 --> 11:25.540
That's right.

11:28.540 --> 11:29.100
Shifang.

11:30.620 --> 11:31.140
Yang.

11:31.940 --> 11:32.260
Shifang.

11:32.820 --> 11:34.780
Our leader sent me to accommodate you.

11:35.260 --> 11:35.900
You're staying

11:36.300 --> 11:37.100
in the Jiqiao Hall.

11:38.140 --> 11:39.140
Jiqiao Hall?

11:40.220 --> 11:41.260
He never said anything

11:41.620 --> 11:42.980
about demoting you.

11:45.700 --> 11:47.620
Shifang, you won

11:47.740 --> 11:49.420
Chen Qianjun and Xu Qiming.

11:49.620 --> 11:50.660
Many people have

11:50.780 --> 11:52.140
changed their opinions about you.

11:52.460 --> 11:54.460
When destroying the stronghold
at the Yinma River.

11:54.700 --> 11:55.900
you should show them

11:56.020 --> 11:57.020
what you've really got.

11:57.340 --> 11:58.500
You'll remain

11:59.140 --> 12:00.580
as the head of the Jiqiao Hall.

12:02.460 --> 12:03.180
I promise

12:03.260 --> 12:04.700
I won't let any of you down.

12:07.700 --> 12:09.580
Alright, I'll leave you to rest.

12:18.100 --> 12:19.620
Alright, stop dazing off.

12:19.820 --> 12:20.460
Tomorrow,

12:20.620 --> 12:21.940
there's a tough battle to fight.

12:24.260 --> 12:26.660
Shifang, what did we tell you?

12:42.900 --> 12:46.020
How do I find a way
to remove the Husheng Spell?

13:02.820 --> 13:03.620
They left you this.

13:22.500 --> 13:23.300
A paper crane.

13:25.660 --> 13:27.540
It's obviously from Ming Xiu.

13:27.940 --> 13:29.700
I thought she would ignore me.

13:37.100 --> 13:37.620
(Little Yue.)

13:37.980 --> 13:40.140
(This kaleidoscope
is full of pretty patterns.)

13:40.460 --> 13:42.100
(Take a look whenever you miss us.)

13:51.500 --> 13:52.100
(Miss Yue.)

13:52.460 --> 13:53.100
(Keep this dagger)

13:53.740 --> 13:54.900
(for self-defense.)

14:04.220 --> 14:05.500
Wolf-fur duster.

14:06.500 --> 14:08.100
I bet it's from Xian Qing.

14:11.310 --> 14:12.460
So handy.

14:46.940 --> 14:47.620
Miss Shuo Xuan,

14:48.020 --> 14:50.100
I'm leaving
the Sea of Clear Skies today.

14:51.420 --> 14:52.900
This is for you.

14:54.500 --> 14:56.700
I'm not interested in these things.

15:08.820 --> 15:10.180
Who'd want your gift?

15:35.180 --> 15:36.460
Come, Jinzhao.

15:36.660 --> 15:37.820
Candied hawthorn.

15:39.220 --> 15:39.860
Qi.

15:41.300 --> 15:42.260
Candied hawthorn.

16:03.140 --> 16:03.900
Visit again.

16:04.060 --> 16:04.540
Thank you.

16:06.460 --> 16:07.100
Mr. Yue.

16:09.340 --> 16:10.100
Some pastries?

16:13.660 --> 16:14.380
The same ones?

16:15.060 --> 16:15.340
Alright.

16:15.580 --> 16:16.180
Alright.

16:17.340 --> 16:18.620
Why are you alone today?

16:19.020 --> 16:20.100
Where is your wife?

16:21.620 --> 16:22.260
At her maiden home.

16:23.580 --> 16:24.500
You should

16:24.620 --> 16:26.580
get her back as soon as possible.

16:31.740 --> 16:32.180
Here.

16:32.180 --> 16:34.500
One extra plum blossom pancake for her.

16:35.020 --> 16:35.540
Here.

16:36.180 --> 16:36.620
Thank you.

16:37.260 --> 16:37.740
Thank you.

16:57.360 --> 17:00.020
♪The butterfly
flies near the fingertips♪

17:00.400 --> 17:03.180
♪Unnoticed by anyone♪

17:06.380 --> 17:09.040
♪The snow lands on the brows♪

17:09.420 --> 17:13.680
♪Bringing back those memories♪

17:14.920 --> 17:18.920
♪Cannot escape the traps set by fate♪

17:19.470 --> 17:23.210
♪Cannot give up emotional attachments♪

17:23.950 --> 17:27.440
♪In this lifetime, you are my obsession♪

17:27.440 --> 17:32.620
♪Yet our happy ending remains elusive♪

17:32.620 --> 17:37.100
♪Fearful of the changing world♪

17:37.100 --> 17:41.260
♪Fearful of not having
the chance to bid you farewell♪

17:41.260 --> 17:45.610
♪Fearful that my memories
will only be filled with longing♪

17:45.610 --> 17:50.630
♪Fearful of seeing you again
yet not recognizing you♪

17:50.630 --> 17:55.050
♪Fearful of dreaming of you and parting♪

17:55.050 --> 17:59.260
♪Fearful that promises
will eventually run aground♪

17:59.260 --> 18:03.830
♪Fearful that it will be
an eternal parting♪

18:03.830 --> 18:07.720
♪Fearful of going through reincarnation
and searching through the world♪

18:08.940 --> 18:10.260
Regardless of our relationship,

18:10.820 --> 18:12.820
we will always be together anyway.

18:14.260 --> 18:15.660
I will be your Husheng.

18:15.780 --> 18:16.620
I will protect you.

18:17.800 --> 18:19.780
Are you going to abandon me?

18:28.020 --> 18:28.620
Qi.

18:46.420 --> 18:47.460
Thinking about Little Yue?

18:53.660 --> 18:55.180
I wonder how she's doing

18:56.180 --> 18:57.230
at the Sea of Clear Skies.

19:00.020 --> 19:02.220
She's the young lord of the Yu Clan.

19:02.380 --> 19:03.820
I bet she's doing well.

19:05.820 --> 19:06.300
Yeah.

19:08.180 --> 19:09.420
She's the young lord now.

19:11.260 --> 19:13.260
She must be doing well.

19:25.300 --> 19:27.300
Honestly, I totally get it.

19:27.580 --> 19:28.060
It's like...

19:28.580 --> 19:29.820
It's like Dou Bao and I.

19:30.180 --> 19:31.420
If Dou Bao leaves me

19:31.580 --> 19:32.820
out of the blue,

19:33.020 --> 19:35.420
I'd be in pain for ages just like you.

19:35.820 --> 19:37.700
You and Little Yue have been together

19:37.860 --> 19:38.740
for so long.

19:39.020 --> 19:41.860
It's normal for you to miss her.

19:42.540 --> 19:44.620
Is it really that Miss Yue
can't live without you

19:44.820 --> 19:46.540
or you can't live without Miss Yue?

20:18.620 --> 20:19.300
Well,

20:20.220 --> 20:22.980
did I say something wrong again?

20:26.540 --> 20:27.100
No.

20:34.660 --> 20:35.500
You're right.

20:38.780 --> 20:40.020
It is always me.

20:44.700 --> 20:46.300
It has always been me
who can't live without her.

20:50.260 --> 20:51.620
It is always me.

20:59.660 --> 21:01.060
It is always me.

21:33.540 --> 21:33.940
Everyone,

21:34.300 --> 21:35.300
we're joining hands today

21:35.700 --> 21:37.460
to eradicate
the stronghold of the Qiyuan Sect.

21:37.580 --> 21:40.140
Please forget about our past grudges.

21:40.300 --> 21:41.940
Eradicating them
for the sake of the people

21:42.060 --> 21:43.140
is part of Luo family's duty.

21:43.260 --> 21:44.100
Mr. Wen, rest assured.

21:44.220 --> 21:45.740
We'll work together.

21:48.980 --> 21:49.660
Everyone,

21:50.260 --> 21:51.820
the Zhengwu Alliance, the Luo family,

21:51.940 --> 21:52.900
and these young masters

21:53.140 --> 21:54.300
are allying today

21:55.060 --> 21:56.780
to eradicate the Qiyuan Sect.

21:57.100 --> 22:02.580
- Eradicate the Qiyuan sect.
- Eradicate the Qiyuan sect.

22:07.470 --> 22:11.180
♪I've never dreamed of the world♪

22:11.780 --> 22:12.380
Qi

22:13.580 --> 22:14.820
should have been here

22:15.100 --> 22:16.100
with us.

22:16.380 --> 22:16.940
Master Yue,

22:18.220 --> 22:19.260
do you want to say something?

22:20.100 --> 22:21.100
May we succeed.

22:21.380 --> 22:22.460
Eradicate the Qiyuan sect.

22:23.940 --> 22:26.460
- May we succeed.
- Eradicate the Qiyuan sect.

22:27.140 --> 22:30.180
- May we succeed.
- Eradicate the Qiyuan sect.

22:30.500 --> 22:33.540
- May we succeed.
- Eradicate the Qiyuan sect.

22:34.020 --> 22:37.220
- May we succeed.
- Eradicate the Qiyuan sect.

22:40.360 --> 22:44.380
♪The destined path
is full of turbulence♪

22:44.380 --> 22:46.730
♪Yet it bothers me not♪

22:46.730 --> 22:51.370
♪I wander around, carefree♪

22:51.370 --> 22:58.670
♪Even if the stars fade away,
I'll still be waiting♪

22:59.050 --> 23:02.830
♪Nostalgic about your gentle look♪

23:05.820 --> 23:08.980
Young heroes.

23:14.410 --> 23:17.230
(Langyin Pavilion,
Stronghold of the Qiyuan Sect)

23:26.700 --> 23:27.380
Meng Cheng.

23:28.820 --> 23:31.140
Any good news, Master?

23:32.060 --> 23:33.420
An edict came from the Didact

23:35.100 --> 23:38.860
that I shall gather all the directors

23:39.140 --> 23:41.180
and take the matured Qiyuan Orb

23:41.300 --> 23:42.340
to the headquarters.

23:42.660 --> 23:43.060
Tell me.

23:44.620 --> 23:46.020
What does it mean?

23:46.580 --> 23:49.020
I-It's quite obvious.

23:49.820 --> 23:52.220
Among all the directors
of the Qiyuan Sect,

23:52.380 --> 23:53.580
you're the most respected.

23:53.700 --> 23:54.300
I believe

23:54.700 --> 23:55.780
the Didact issued this edict

23:55.940 --> 23:56.940
for you to show up

23:57.260 --> 23:59.180
in front of all our fellow disciples

23:59.540 --> 24:01.420
before making you

24:02.020 --> 24:03.460
the next sect leader.

24:04.860 --> 24:05.500
It is urgent.

24:05.980 --> 24:08.060
I'd better get ready

24:08.180 --> 24:09.260
and head to the headquarters.

24:13.060 --> 24:13.540
Master.

24:17.100 --> 24:19.780
You're about to be made the sect leader.

24:19.900 --> 24:21.260
The Langyin Pavilion...

24:23.300 --> 24:24.300
Enough.

24:24.940 --> 24:27.740
I'll make you the director here.

24:28.980 --> 24:31.100
- Take great care of it.
- Alright.

24:31.220 --> 24:32.380
- You hear me?
- Yes.

24:56.660 --> 24:58.700
The entrance must be nearby.

24:59.300 --> 25:00.660
Why don't we split up?

25:01.020 --> 25:01.940
It's a difficult terrain.

25:02.220 --> 25:03.100
We should stay close.

25:03.700 --> 25:04.660
Let's go in pairs.

25:04.740 --> 25:05.300
Keep in touch.

25:05.740 --> 25:06.340
Alright.

25:07.020 --> 25:07.540
Let's go.

25:11.500 --> 25:12.420
Shifang, let's go.

25:12.860 --> 25:13.620
Alright.

25:19.020 --> 25:19.620
Xu.

25:20.980 --> 25:22.740
I don't get it. Why did Mr. Wen send

25:23.060 --> 25:23.820
two untrustworthy guys

25:23.940 --> 25:24.900
with us as scouts

25:25.060 --> 25:25.740
and stay on standby

25:26.740 --> 25:28.020
with Master Luo and Miss Ming

25:28.460 --> 25:29.580
under the mountain?

25:31.260 --> 25:33.220
I believe there is a good reason.

26:18.020 --> 26:18.820
Footprints.

26:25.300 --> 26:25.860
Watch out!

26:37.580 --> 26:38.980
Thank you for saving my life.

26:40.700 --> 26:42.060
How did you know it was a trap?

26:45.340 --> 26:46.940
The footprints looked artificial.

26:46.940 --> 26:47.980
I knew it was fishy.

26:48.660 --> 26:49.780
You're truly observant.

26:49.940 --> 26:50.740
I admire you.

26:50.940 --> 26:52.540
It's nothing. Stay alert.

26:53.180 --> 26:53.620
Yes.

26:53.820 --> 26:54.820
If there's a trap here,

26:55.100 --> 26:56.540
then the entrance to the Qiyuan Sect

26:56.660 --> 26:57.620
must be close by.

26:58.100 --> 26:58.420
Yeah.

26:59.500 --> 27:00.220
Are you okay, Xu?

27:00.580 --> 27:00.900
I'm fine.

27:01.580 --> 27:02.860
Master Yue saved me.

27:03.580 --> 27:03.980
Jinzhao.

27:04.780 --> 27:06.620
Jinzhao, I heard something

27:06.740 --> 27:07.700
from the stone wall.

27:07.860 --> 27:08.460
I think

27:08.580 --> 27:10.060
the stronghold is behind there.

27:10.220 --> 27:11.220
Let's go take a look.

27:11.340 --> 27:11.860
Alright.

27:28.100 --> 27:28.860
Captives.

27:43.060 --> 27:44.700
I didn't expect this stronghold

27:44.860 --> 27:45.900
to be so heavily guarded.

27:46.020 --> 27:47.420
It's going to be a tough battle.

27:48.700 --> 27:49.940
Let's get down the mountain

27:50.060 --> 27:51.220
and inform Mr. Wen first.

27:51.460 --> 27:51.820
Alright.

27:51.980 --> 27:52.460
Wait.

27:56.380 --> 27:57.620
It's just the Langyin Pavilion.

27:58.180 --> 27:59.460
Shifang and I can handle it.

28:01.940 --> 28:03.580
Someone really knows how to bluff.

28:04.180 --> 28:05.820
Qianjun, let's wait

28:07.460 --> 28:09.380
and see what Master Yue is up to.

28:12.820 --> 28:13.260
Jinzhao,

28:13.500 --> 28:15.220
so that's why you told me

28:15.340 --> 28:16.340
to make the masks?

28:16.780 --> 28:17.460
Chances

28:17.580 --> 28:19.620
favor those who are prepared.

28:35.660 --> 28:36.260
Who are you?

28:37.580 --> 28:38.980
Get your director here.

28:39.780 --> 28:40.780
How dare you

28:41.100 --> 28:42.500
ask to see Director Meng?

28:43.300 --> 28:44.100
Are you suicidal?

28:45.340 --> 28:45.900
Guards.

28:49.580 --> 28:51.860
Let me see who's so bold.

28:52.300 --> 28:55.180
How dare you ask to see me?

28:58.900 --> 28:59.620
Didact.

29:00.140 --> 29:01.340
Please forgive me.

29:04.060 --> 29:04.660
How dare you!

29:04.980 --> 29:06.140
Didact is here.

29:06.260 --> 29:07.180
Where are your manners?

29:07.340 --> 29:08.220
Get lost!

29:08.980 --> 29:11.020
Get lost. Hurry up.

29:13.980 --> 29:16.060
Master Yue is really smart.

29:18.180 --> 29:18.900
And you are...

29:19.340 --> 29:19.820
Me?

29:20.180 --> 29:23.220
I am the Didact's bodyguard.

29:24.140 --> 29:25.020
Nice to meet you, sir.

29:26.100 --> 29:27.780
Didact, may I ask

29:27.980 --> 29:29.180
what brought you here?

29:35.140 --> 29:36.220
W-What does it mean?

29:37.300 --> 29:38.860
You don't do your job well.

29:39.860 --> 29:41.700
Didact works all day and got sick.

29:41.940 --> 29:42.780
He can't talk now.

29:44.380 --> 29:45.420
You've been made director.

29:45.540 --> 29:47.220
How come you don't get what he wants?

29:47.900 --> 29:49.540
Yeah, you're right.

29:56.860 --> 29:58.220
Didact means

29:59.340 --> 30:01.820
our strongholds are getting eradicated

30:01.940 --> 30:03.140
one after another.

30:03.900 --> 30:06.100
Only you guys are doing well.

30:06.300 --> 30:07.660
Let's try to barge in later.

30:09.940 --> 30:10.620
Exactly.

30:11.060 --> 30:13.420
The stronghold here is heavily guarded.

30:18.180 --> 30:19.620
Are you going to...

30:20.900 --> 30:21.540
reward me?

30:23.780 --> 30:24.860
Punish me.

30:25.340 --> 30:26.700
I'm sorry.

30:27.020 --> 30:27.620
My apologies.

30:30.060 --> 30:31.700
Didact means

30:33.060 --> 30:34.380
that you've done a great job.

30:35.060 --> 30:36.220
You deserve some rewards,

30:36.340 --> 30:37.900
so he's taking you somewhere.

30:40.140 --> 30:41.700
Thank you, Didact.

30:55.300 --> 30:55.900
Go!

31:02.980 --> 31:04.860
You're disguising as me?

31:05.300 --> 31:07.660
Yue Jinzhao,
you've learned a trick or two.

31:12.900 --> 31:15.100
Meng Cheng, it's been so long.

31:16.340 --> 31:17.020
Who are you?

31:21.380 --> 31:22.780
So it's you.

31:23.220 --> 31:25.380
You look so much like Didact
with the mask on.

31:25.500 --> 31:26.620
Where is the headquarters?

31:27.380 --> 31:28.460
I'm loyal to Lord Ming.

31:28.580 --> 31:29.980
I won't tell you where it is.

31:31.340 --> 31:32.020
Alright.

31:33.700 --> 31:35.740
D-Don't kill me.

31:36.780 --> 31:37.740
Tell me exactly

31:38.100 --> 31:39.260
where your headquarters is.

31:39.340 --> 31:40.260
Fine.

31:40.620 --> 31:42.180
I'll tell you.

31:48.140 --> 31:48.860
Excuse me.

31:49.300 --> 31:51.340
Have you heard of the Husheng Spell?

31:51.460 --> 31:52.020
Husheng Spell?

31:54.340 --> 31:55.220
It's a spell

31:55.460 --> 31:58.100
that removes one's memories
and personality.

31:59.020 --> 32:00.060
Remember what I told you?

32:00.940 --> 32:01.660
It's at his place.

32:04.430 --> 32:05.140
Excuse me.

32:05.420 --> 32:07.020
Have you heard of the Husheng Spell?

32:07.540 --> 32:08.220
Husheng Spell?

32:08.580 --> 32:09.180
Have you?

32:11.020 --> 32:12.220
We've never heard of it

32:12.340 --> 32:13.140
as we were born.

32:13.260 --> 32:14.060
Right.

32:14.540 --> 32:15.920
- Never heard of it.
- Never heard of it.

32:19.620 --> 32:20.180
Grandpa.

32:24.540 --> 32:27.380
Do you know about the Husheng Spell?

32:28.180 --> 32:28.940
What spell?

32:29.340 --> 32:30.500
Husheng Spell.

32:31.220 --> 32:31.940
What spell?

32:32.620 --> 32:34.060
Husheng Spell.

32:36.220 --> 32:36.980
Young lord.

32:37.540 --> 32:39.100
If you want to learn spells,

32:39.500 --> 32:40.580
read the books in the hall.

32:42.620 --> 32:45.820
I've never
learned any spells in my life.

32:46.300 --> 32:47.380
I'm not reading books.

32:49.900 --> 32:50.620
Read books?

33:31.060 --> 33:31.900
Meditation Spell.

33:34.260 --> 33:35.460
Meditation Spell.

33:39.020 --> 33:43.380
It allows people to enter
the sea of awareness of any creature.

33:44.580 --> 33:46.860
If I enter Zhu Yu's sea of awareness,

33:47.340 --> 33:48.220
then I'll find a way

33:48.380 --> 33:50.260
to remove the Husheng Spell.

34:09.360 --> 34:11.060
Whose sea of awareness is it?

34:13.860 --> 34:17.260
Life is so hard.

34:33.780 --> 34:34.940
You're the lantern.

34:37.500 --> 34:38.580
So you're alive.

34:38.739 --> 34:40.060
I've been a lantern for ages.

34:40.219 --> 34:43.260
I forgot that I'm a living fish.

34:43.420 --> 34:45.900
Why do I lead such a miserable life?

34:46.060 --> 34:49.060
Why do I have to work so hard?

34:49.290 --> 34:50.380
Work?

34:51.850 --> 34:52.940
What do you do?

34:57.540 --> 34:59.780
I emit light and heat

34:59.940 --> 35:02.820
to light up
the street for the Yu people.

35:03.180 --> 35:06.140
Why do we have to work?

35:06.740 --> 35:10.140
Why can't I lie back and do nothing?

35:11.060 --> 35:13.620
I've been working for 300 years.

35:13.820 --> 35:17.260
When is it ever going to end?

35:18.020 --> 35:21.540
Life is so hard.

35:36.100 --> 35:37.380
The Meditation Spell worked.

35:59.870 --> 36:02.980
♪Looking back♪

36:03.870 --> 36:06.720
♪I try to bring back memories♪

36:07.740 --> 36:11.740
♪We're connected♪

36:11.970 --> 36:14.080
♪It's meant to be♪

36:15.770 --> 36:18.920
♪I've fallen in love silently♪

36:20.000 --> 36:22.970
♪Years leave no trace behind♪

36:23.710 --> 36:25.890
♪On a moonlight night♪

36:25.890 --> 36:27.710
♪I lapsed into my memories♪

36:27.970 --> 36:30.110
♪About you♪

36:30.650 --> 36:33.890
♪All laughter and joy are about you♪

36:34.650 --> 36:37.970
♪It's unforgettable. It's all about you♪

36:38.620 --> 36:40.480
♪The past glided before my mind♪

36:40.480 --> 36:42.720
♪I smiled and cried♪

36:42.720 --> 36:47.450
♪For happiness♪

36:47.970 --> 36:51.680
♪I went about the world looking for you♪

36:51.970 --> 36:55.900
♪All I have was the echo in the valley♪

36:55.900 --> 36:57.920
♪In this tranquil world♪

36:57.920 --> 36:59.900
♪I've finally found you♪

36:59.900 --> 37:04.000
♪I'll spend the rest
of my life with you♪

37:04.000 --> 37:07.770
♪I've been looking for you♪

37:07.770 --> 37:12.030
♪I wish to share joy
and sorrow with you♪

37:12.770 --> 37:14.270
♪Among the vast sea of people♪

37:14.270 --> 37:16.480
♪I engrave your name♪

37:16.480 --> 37:22.810
♪Believe me, you're the only one♪

37:37.950 --> 37:40.940
♪Wind rises and rain ceases♪

37:41.980 --> 37:44.920
♪During the long-lost quiet time♪

37:45.950 --> 37:49.820
♪Both of us get closer♪

37:49.820 --> 37:51.970
♪And watch the stars♪

37:53.760 --> 37:56.880
♪I've fallen in love silently♪

37:57.950 --> 38:00.990
♪Stories leave no trace behind♪

38:01.730 --> 38:03.710
♪On a moonlight night♪

38:03.930 --> 38:05.850
♪I lapsed into my memories♪

38:05.850 --> 38:08.740
♪About you♪

38:08.740 --> 38:12.140
♪All laughter and joy are about you♪

38:12.670 --> 38:14.240
♪It's unforgettable♪

38:14.240 --> 38:16.030
♪It's all about you♪

38:16.800 --> 38:18.270
♪The past glided before my mind♪

38:18.270 --> 38:20.670
♪I smiled and cried♪

38:20.670 --> 38:25.450
♪For happiness♪

38:26.240 --> 38:29.730
♪I went about the world looking for you♪

38:29.920 --> 38:33.970
♪All I have was the echo in the valley♪

38:33.970 --> 38:35.900
♪In this tranquil world♪

38:35.900 --> 38:37.920
♪I've finally found you♪

38:37.920 --> 38:42.050
♪I'll spend the rest
of my life with you♪

38:42.050 --> 38:45.950
♪I've been looking for you♪

38:45.950 --> 38:50.170
♪I wish to share joy
and sorrow with you♪

38:50.750 --> 38:52.450
♪Among the vast sea of people♪

38:52.450 --> 38:54.460
♪I engrave your name♪

38:54.460 --> 39:00.790
♪Believe me, you're the only one♪
